		Heading 1:
			Text: Rotate
		Paragraph: `Rotate` turns the block around its center, in degrees clockwise. In the flow the block takes the rectangle that encloses it once rotated, so the text before and after it moves aside.
			Style: intro
		Text: Rotate: -8
			Style: label
